nd with wave-like flares, severity about 7-8/10. Reports intermittent pink/red urine, mild burning with urination, and unintentional weight loss of about 23 kg in the last 2-3 months. Relevant structured record from patient knowledge base: increased fatigue, mild hematuria, creatinine 1.4 mg/dL, eGFR 61 mL/min/1.73m², prior renal cell carcinoma follow-up, post-nephrectomy status, monitoring eGFR decline, on Sunitinib 50 mg daily, family history of renal cell carcinoma in maternal uncle. User is very scared and asks for next steps and recommendations.\" --diagnosis \"Kidney imaging pipeline output on newly uploaded CT image: Kidney Cancer Detector class kidney_tumor, confidence 0.9999794960021973 (~99.99%), inference time 3.27 s. Image Analyzer prediction kidney_tumor. CAM metrics: coverage 0.012755102040816327, center_ratio 0.8249999997937499, lr_asym 0.099999999975, tb_asym 0.99999999975. CAM explanation: The model focused on a localized region of the image, located centrally within the renal parenchyma, with asymmetric spatial distribution. In the context of a tumor prediction, this pattern suggests visually distinct renal regions that may correspond to localized structural alteration. xAI summary: The provided medical image analysis suggests a high likelihood of kidney cancer, with a confidence level of 99.99%. Visual evidence points to a kidney tumor, but medical imaging analysis is not a definitive diagnostic tool. Recommended next steps from tool: further medical evaluation including imaging studies and laboratory tests; consultation with a medical professional; consider additional diagnostic tests such as biopsy or genetic testing. Important caveat: this tool output is preliminary and not a diagnosis.\"","workdir":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-demo-agent","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":120},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 ~/.openclaw/skills/llm-distillator/scripts/distill_health_response.py --context \\\"Patient reports feeling quite exhausted lately with persistent dull right lower back/right flank pain under the ribs, worsening over the last few months. Pain worsens with changing position or walking, has a constant background with wave-like flares, severity about 7-8/10. Reports intermittent pink/red urine, mild burning with urination, and unintentional weight loss of about 23 kg in the last 2-3 months. Relevant structured record from patient knowledge base: increased fatigue, mild hematuria, creatinine 1.4 mg/dL, eGFR 61 mL/min/1.73m², prior renal cell carcinoma follow-up, post-nephrectomy status, monitoring eGFR decline, on Sunitinib 50 mg daily, family history of renal cell carcinoma in maternal uncle. User is very scared and asks for next steps and recommendations.\\\" --diagnosis \\\"Kidney imaging pipeline output on newly uploaded CT image: Kidney Cancer Detector class kidney_tumor, confidence 0.9999794960021973 (~99.99%), inference time 3.27 s. Image Analyzer prediction kidney_tumor. CAM metrics: coverage 0.012755102040816327, center_ratio 0.8249999997937499, lr_asym 0.099999999975, tb_asym 0.99999999975. CAM explanation: The model focused on a localized region of the image, located centrally within the renal parenchyma, with asymmetric spatial distribution. In the context of a tumor prediction, this pattern suggests visually distinct renal regions that may correspond to localized structural alteration. xAI summary: The provided medical image analysis suggests a high likelihood of kidney cancer, with a confidence level of 99.99%. Visual evidence points to a kidney tumor, but medical imaging analysis is not a definitive diagnostic tool. Recommended next steps from tool: further medical evaluation including imaging studies and laboratory tests; consultation with a medical professional; consider additional diagnostic tests such as biopsy or genetic testing. Important caveat: this tool output is preliminary and not a diagnosis.\\\"\",\"workdir\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-demo-agent\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":120}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":947,"output":544,"cacheRead":29952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31443,"cost":{"input":0.0023675000000000002,"output":0.00816,"cacheRead":0.007488,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0180155}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774685946092}}
