{"type":"message","id":"788ec6c6","parentId":"1afb4a87","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:19:53.442Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0ab7ac9648b5f8610169c78f23b7b881919c0826581204a63c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpx48k4cx54JpmV-TKj5uRar1iwCe7yroAH25sCgKUuctWtgmyrCP4awrNWxwPuwqw1DtiN6h9Hhjsvpjfas2U5dVw8RIYnTopmkoYDwp8lvhbSAht-q5phWh89zOBwdCm1oIKD8ZGjVz6hNTY6MhQsic4Ns9d5AjSFOfOLi1kFRKIsct6rIfaTH_iS9XQioyKSIDT5waWef-His0MnaJnECLWVJYwBZan880Oy1FshxM31dnMFZUzLB68fivipD_XTRAUdgE27jjs09isnQaM7rwBsLUTRkyM3Tr-GtUrdTurpJI8Ug5nasRnzLgctzR8dqP1rTEMU5tJpQq8KflUCOn0ADTV83YLy1wMVuvJz-j4ET8r3owZ03yK8KYzxoylHzSnzRynrlignOh6CJ3EeGlwZdgm-pG14NMgkX4MGHPuKUURNNJaOwLMOoyfGpNUecg8mYVpPWOwGn8C7w8QyZFlqPuvAqGnUPPwwASAc6jHW6vCiB1kVaBUxlpvOqHDThr7a1S-BaQp4VtAZqm6d7E5kjXfA1iUVtr4OQAQoX7PiB2abQoeI-JIP4j1opzBXUYBhte676_oTJadl_e3jcLEuFOg7anr944EbPbrTbmFSDST1pBALMMzY4h7AWYQjOcBUF1V_ZRB-uz4i7V0Ec6YjSJjs80CbzKlLn7Nb8seq6ChSEhN17RK1p-kDGzLBFZdd05wmgdkn4XX3fuUAYMzGwEsuc_m8bGr1oSUWBx0NTxBWQTR0QUC9Ag4gRt7NaYsSgXCQnJR4A-bWWN8xUTKiPtMTna0ox4hVMaSjleu8nGkDRPD5iv4j1ZIDXdHYndROZIUIfmqj1siUtelLujof-zMiPao7qPOy68eWk5FBwg=\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] You can send this:\n\n**Short message for your doctor / triage**\nHello, I need an urgent assessment today. I have a history of **renal cell carcinoma follow-up** and **nephrectomy**. Over the last few months I’ve developed **worsening right flank pain under the ribs**, now about **7–8/10**, with **pink/red urine at times**, **burning when urinating**, **marked fatigue**, and about **23 kg unintentional weight loss over 2–3 months**. I’m worried this could be a serious kidney or urinary tract problem and would like urgent review, labs/urine tests, and imaging assessment.\n\n**If you go to the ER, say this at check-in**\nI have **prior kidney cancer follow-up and prior nephrectomy**, and now I have **worsening right-sided flank pain, blood in urine, burning urination, fatigue, and major recent weight loss**. I need urgent evaluation.\n\n**If you want an even shorter version**\nHistory of kidney cancer follow-up/nephrectomy. Now worsening right flank pain, hematuria, dysuria, fatigue, and major unintentional weight loss. Requesting urgent same-day evaluation.\n\nIf you want, I can also help you write:\n- a **more formal message for your oncologist/urologist**, or\n- a **very short Italian version** you can copy-paste immediately.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ab7ac9648b5f8610169c78f243c608191a03468fecdd3ff14\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2112,"output":314,"cacheRead":29952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32378,"cost":{"input":0.005280000000000001,"output":0.00471,"cacheRead":0.007488,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.017478}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774685985541}}
